### P2P flow – run with the "REST Client" VS Code extension (humao.rest-client)
### Start the server first: cds watch
### Mocked users (empty password) and their roles: see package.json → cds.requires.[development].auth.users
###   alice, erin = Requester | carol = Approver+Requester | henry = Approver (limit 5,000)
###   bob = Buyer+Warehouse (plants 1000, 1100) | dave = Buyer (2000, 3000) | walt = Warehouse (2000)
###   paula = AccountsPayable | frank = Approver+AccountsPayable+APManager | admin = Admin

@server = http://localhost:4004
@laptop = 20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@techsource = 10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

### 1. alice creates a requisition (→ creates a DRAFT, IsActiveEntity=false)
# @name newPR
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/requisition/PurchaseRequisitions
Authorization: Basic alice:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "12 laptops for the new Hamburg team",
  "neededBy": "2027-01-31",
  "items": [
    { "material_ID": "{{laptop}}", "quantity": 12, "preferredSupplier_ID": "{{techsource}}" }
  ]
}

### 2. activate the draft (= "Save" button in Fiori) → prNo, totals, item numbers are assigned
@prID = {{newPR.response.body.ID}}
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/requisition/PurchaseRequisitions(ID={{prID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/RequisitionService.draftActivate
Authorization: Basic alice:
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 3. submit for approval
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/requisition/PurchaseRequisitions(ID={{prID}},IsActiveEntity=true)/RequisitionService.submit
Authorization: Basic alice:
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 4a. alice tries to approve → 403 (she has no Approver role; see srv/access-control.cds)
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/approval/Requisitions({{prID}})/ApprovalService.approve
Authorization: Basic alice:
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 4b. carol approves (limit 50,000)
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/approval/Requisitions({{prID}})/ApprovalService.approve
Authorization: Basic carol:
Content-Type: application/json

{ "comment": "OK for onboarding" }

### 5. bob converts the PR into a purchase order
# @name newPO
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/requisition/PurchaseRequisitions(ID={{prID}},IsActiveEntity=true)/RequisitionService.createPurchaseOrder
Authorization: Basic bob:
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 6. look at the PO with items and schedule lines
@poID = {{newPO.response.body.ID}}
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/purchasing/PurchaseOrders(ID={{poID}},IsActiveEntity=true)?$expand=items($expand=scheduleLines),supplier($select=name),status
Authorization: Basic bob:

### 7. release the PO to the supplier
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/purchasing/PurchaseOrders(ID={{poID}},IsActiveEntity=true)/PurchasingService.release
Authorization: Basic bob:
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 8. post a goods receipt for all open quantities (items omitted)
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/purchasing/PurchaseOrders(ID={{poID}},IsActiveEntity=true)/PurchasingService.postGoodsReceipt
Authorization: Basic bob:
Content-Type: application/json

{ "deliveryNote": "DN-4711" }

### 9. get the PO item ID for the invoice
# @name poItems
GET {{server}}/odata/v4/invoice/PurchaseOrders({{poID}})/items?$select=ID,itemNo,quantity,receivedQuantity,netPrice
Authorization: Basic frank:

### 10. frank enters the supplier invoice (price 1,200 instead of 1,150 → will be BLOCKED)
# @name newInvoice
@poItemID = {{poItems.response.body.value[0].ID}}
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/invoice/SupplierInvoices
Authorization: Basic frank:
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierRef": "TS-2026-1201",
  "purchaseOrder_ID": "{{poID}}",
  "items": [ { "poItem_ID": "{{poItemID}}", "quantity": 12, "unitPrice": 1200 } ]
}

### 11. activate → 3-way match runs automatically (status BLK, see matchMessage)
@invID = {{newInvoice.response.body.ID}}
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/invoice/SupplierInvoices(ID={{invID}},IsActiveEntity=false)/InvoiceService.draftActivate
Authorization: Basic frank:
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 12. override the block, then pay → PO gets status CLS (closed)
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/invoice/SupplierInvoices(ID={{invID}},IsActiveEntity=true)/InvoiceService.overrideBlock
Authorization: Basic frank:
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Price increase agreed by phone" }

###
POST {{server}}/odata/v4/invoice/SupplierInvoices(ID={{invID}},IsActiveEntity=true)/InvoiceService.markPaid
Authorization: Basic frank:
Content-Type: application/json

{}
